pcl-ui-400.woff2 and pcl-ui-600.woff2 are subsets of Noto Sans CJK
version 2.004, converted to WOFF2 for the launcher interface. Both retain
the upstream copyright notice in their font metadata.
Glyphs outside the subset use the system's CJK fallback font.

pcl-ui-400.woff2 is Regular, with an internal weight of 400.
pcl-ui-600.woff2 is Bold, with an internal weight of 700; the filename
and the interface CSS map this Bold subset to the interface's 600 weight.
These font files remain under OFL 1.1 and are not covered by the project's
MIT license.
